from parts/underground-down.replay
# sys-underground-dig (mining.c): a bulging wall east of the arrival under Eterna
# City; A asks to dig, YES opens the board (the spot goes, FLAG_DIGGING_FOR_FOSSILS), the first board's tutorial, then the
# board is struck with the pickaxe until it ends; up again, the Underground Man's second mission gives three spheres.
# Setup: to a bulging wall east of the arrival (the day's spots are the save's: the same on every seed).
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_UNDERGROUND 198 260 left
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
until app mining
+1 screenshot mining-prompt
+0 tap yes
# The fade, the ping, "Something pinged in the wall!" (80 ticks), then the first board's tutorial (seven pages).
+110 tap next
+2 tap next
+2 tap next
+2 tap next
+2 tap next
+2 tap next
+2 tap next
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_DIGGING_FOR_FOSSILS true
+1 screenshot mining-board
# The pickaxe (4 off the wall a strike) over the three Spheres the wall holds (the visit's generator is seeded from the
# frozen clock and the Underground step count at arrival, the weights by the even trainer id: the same board on every seed): everything is
# dug up, then each is named and put away.
+3 tap hit:88,168
+3 tap hit:104,184
+3 tap hit:56,72
+3 tap hit:184,104
+3 tap hit:168,120
+3 tap hit:200,120
+3 tap hit:184,136
+3 tap hit:88,168
+3 tap hit:104,184
+2 screenshot mining-dig
+3 tap hit:40,56
+3 tap hit:56,72
+3 tap hit:184,104
+3 tap hit:168,120
+3 tap hit:200,120
+3 tap hit:184,136
+3 tap hit:88,168
+3 tap hit:104,184
+40 assert app mining
+0 screenshot mining-items
until app none 3000
+0 assert state underground.mined true
+0 assert state underground.records.spheresDug 3
# Up again and to the Underground Man: he gives the second mission, already done (FLAG_DIGGING_FOR_FOSSILS), and then a
# Prism, a Red and a Blue Sphere.
+0 press x
+1 release x
until app ug-menu
+1 tap entry:5
+1 tap yes
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_ETERNA_CITY"
until idle
+0 press up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_ETERNA_CITY_UNDERGROUND_MAN_HOUSE"
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 4 6
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press right
until position 6 6
+0 release right
until idle
+0 press up
+1 release up
+4 press a
+5 release a
advance text
until idle
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HAS_ACTIVE_UNDERGROUND_MISSION true
# The mission (dig) is already done: talking again rewards it.
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until idle
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_CURRENT_UNDERGROUND_MISSION 2
+0 assert state underground.spheres [{"type":4,"size":10},{"type":4,"size":20},{"type":3,"size":10},{"type":1,"size":1},{"type":3,"size":1},{"type":4,"size":1}]
